# ---- LIVE LADDER FLIP ANALYSIS ----
# ladder (alphabet.rs:118-124): 1..=8 NibbleLut / 9..=16 WideLut / _ MultiCmp
# nibble/multi crossover N*=3: MultiCmp cheaper for N<3, NibbleLut cheaper for N>=3
